{"t":"SYF","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Synchrony Financial","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","employees":20000,"hq":"Stamford, CT, United States","website":"https://www.synchrony.com","summary_en":"Synchrony Financial, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a consumer financial services company in the United States. The company provides credit products, such as credit cards, commercial credit products, and consumer installment loans. It also offers private label credit cards, dual and general purpose co-branded cards, short- and long-term installment loans, and consumer banking products; and deposit products, including certificates of deposit, individual retirement accounts, money market accounts, savings accounts, and sweep and affinity deposits, as well as accepts deposits through third-party firms. In addition, the company provides debt cancellation products to its credit card customers through online and mobile channels; and healthcare payments and financing solutions under the CareCredit and Walgreens brands; payments and financing solutions in the apparel, specialty retail, outdoor, music, and luxury industries, such as American Eagle, Dick's Sporting Goods, Guitar Center, Pandora, Polaris, Suzuki, and Sweetwater. It offers its credit products through programs established with a group of national and regional retailers, local merchants, manufacturers, buying groups, industry associations, and healthcare service providers; and deposit products through various channels, such as digital and print. It serves digital, health and wellness, retail, home, auto, telecommunications, pet, outdoor, and other industries. The company was founded in 1932 and is headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"싱크로니 파이낸셜(Synchrony Financial)은 자회사와 함께 미국에서 소비자 금융 서비스 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 회사는 신용카드, 기업신용상품, 소비자 할부대출 등 신용상품을 제공하고 있습니다. 또한 자체 브랜드 신용카드, 이중 및 범용 공동 브랜드 카드, 단기 및 장기 할부 대출, 소비자 금융 상품도 제공합니다. 예금 증서, 개인 퇴직 계좌, 머니 마켓 계좌, 저축 계좌, 스윕 및 친화성 예금을 포함한 예금 상품은 물론 제3자 회사를 통한 예금도 허용합니다. 또한, 신용카드 고객에게 온라인 및 모바일 채널을 통해 채무면제 상품을 제공하고 있습니다. CareCredit 및 Walgreens 브랜드의 의료 결제 및 금융 솔루션; American Eagle, Dick's Sporting Goods, Guitar Center, Pandora, Polaris, Suzuki 및 Sweetwater와 같은 의류, 전문 소매업, 아웃도어, 음악 및 명품 산업 분야의 결제 및 금융 솔루션입니다. 전국 및 지역 소매업체, 현지 상인, 제조업체, 구매 그룹, 산업 협회 및 의료 서비스 제공업체와 함께 구축한 프로그램을 통해 신용 상품을 제공합니다. 디지털, 인쇄 등 다양한 채널을 통해 제품을 예치합니다. 디지털, 건강 및 웰니스, 소매, 가정, 자동차, 통신, 애완동물, 야외 및 기타 산업에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1932년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷주 스탬포드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":74.07,"mcap":24100218880.0,"pe":7.731733,"fpe":7.065847,"peg":0.929,"ps":2.4634793,"pb":1.5528301,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":1.84,"beta":1.395,"hi52":88.77,"lo52":63.08},"fin":{"rev":9783000064.0,"rev_g":-0.047,"eps_g":-0.063,"gross":0.0,"op":0.49842998,"net":0.34069002,"roe":0.1983,"fcf":null,"cash":15900999680.0,"debt":17025000448.0,"de":null,"eps":9.58,"feps":10.48282},"own":{"short":0.0672,"inst":1.13279,"insider":0.00368},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":87.0,"median":88.0,"high":103.0,"low":76.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.95652,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":10,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":10,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":12,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":80.0,"priorPriceTarget":81.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":77.0,"priorPriceTarget":74.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":78.0,"priorPriceTarget":80.0},{"GradeDate":"